title: Remove dead referenda from the track queue
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Cancel and kill now remove a queued referendum from its track queue. The queue
    drain in one_fewer_deciding now persists the drained queue, which also cleans
    entries a chain carries from before this change. The try_state check now
    requires every queue entry to be an ongoing referendum on its own track.
crates:
- name: pallet-referenda
  bump: patch
